<title>UK: BT says Telenor to join Viag Interkom venture.</title>
<headline>BT says Telenor to join Viag Interkom venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Thursday that Norway's Telenor telecoms company would take a 10 percent stake in BT's Viag Interkom venture with Germany's Viag AG.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Earlier this week, Viag and BT were awarded a licence to offer mobile services in Germany using the DCS 1800 standard.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
